>Step 3: Name the action and select which tags should be added to these contacts; then \"Add Tags\"</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 4: Check the progress by clicking on the success percentages.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-29ed64d9-9605-4fc2-aba8-98ec3640902d\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834092/original/scyVr4PTKsxiSsgXegZWYBX3NdQwIj7C0g2140.png?1724860291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834092\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 285px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834096/original/gBQnEyla7kGNULhFoIFXyA9s7XhG_sjebQ2140.jpg?1724860291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834096\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 503px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-6ee78072-7027-4dfa-8218-fcc725d845d5\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\">Feature 2 - Bulk Remove Tags to Selected Contacts</h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-29ed64d9-9605-4fc2-aba8-98ec3640902d\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">You can select multiple contacts and remove tags using a bulk action.</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">How to:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 1: Select a few contacts</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 2: Click on \"Remove Tag\" bulk action</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 3: Name the action and select which tags should be removed to these contacts; or option to remove all tags.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 4: Click on \"Remove Tags\"</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 5: Check the progress by clicking on the success percentages.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834094/original/TxLpwBXCBXhUWeUHSm_jswONGbjGKr8LJQ2140.png?1724860291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834094\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 341px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834093/original/Stba_jmP426SCpccdfgGLndGkVLGDL5PPg2140.png?1724860291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834093\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 339px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834095/original/eOp6hJfARMGQEWdNonYvhaeKmQcJhDgV9Q2140.jpg?1724860291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834095\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 612px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7c448028-7d17-4b81-9d24-6adb2fa43256\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-a8d0d245-0aa0-4c4f-9273-e4de3314af61\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-6ee78072-7027-4dfa-8218-fcc725d845d5\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Feature 3 - Restore Removed Tags&nbsp;</h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0d78df87-c4a3-4752-a2a3-e2484207478e\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">You can now restore removed tags now.</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How to:</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 1: Go to Bulk Actions page and click on the kebab menu (3 dots menu) on the right</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 2: Click on Restore and this will start the restore process</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Step 3: The new action would start appearing in the bulk actions page as a new action</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834090/original/OSJUzMPPn_opSYSQuNfEG2-2Yaf70cR4HA2140.jpg?1724860291\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834090\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><h1 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-c48a203a-5893-4632-b80c-868904af44a5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: inherit; font-size: 2em;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031834097/original/OucoYLFo0JztYb9Zy_y_HrxX7kXJJvvULA5a2d.jpg?1724860292\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155031834097\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></h1><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></p></span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001236787-how-to-set-up-a-workflow-for-the-affiliate-manager-", "title": "How to set up a Workflow for the Affiliate Manager?", "folder": "Affiliate Manager Workflow", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942176/original/gNfhyS5hJSk6-c-pTG_OapbvQutIn7cLGA5f9e.png?1680598073", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942177/original/PciQXJ-M4TDrioRRmgYxBiYn4RjE8PtO2Q5f9e.png?1680598073", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942174/original/tvurjdZCORKlRGFFgucD_VvpsA3UeRB9rw5f9e.png?1680598073", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942175/original/tauJYfNADRGRCZ9HwPw3oSvDqhXbTIBbXQ5f9e.png?1680598073", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942172/original/nDkPdxo1axAp6iMAS9iddghH7InwpPl9Owa1cc.png?1680598072", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942169/original/NY0fdWk7R1kG3j2c65pDQBcFRM3sCothog8bb6.png?1680598071", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48290942173/original/eI_gtrNaOWX1uaZ