\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"509\"><span data-identifyelement=\"510\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Starting July 5, 2023, all SMS and MMS messages to U.S. phone numbers using 10DLC phone numbers must be part of a registered A2P campaign. Failure to comply may result in message blocking. Ensure your phone numbers and messaging campaigns are properly registered to avoid disruption in your messaging services.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"511\"><br data-identifyelement=\"512\"></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" id=\"Covered-in-this-Article\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1687185369818\" data-identifyelement=\"514\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article</span></strong></h4><p><a data-identifyelement=\"522\" href=\"#What-do-you-need-to-know?\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">What do you need to know?</span></a></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"524\" href=\"#Why-is-this-happening?\">Why is this happening?</a></span></p><p><a data-identifyelement=\"526\" href=\"#What-do-you-need-to-do?\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">What do you need to do?</span></a></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1687184087117\" data-identifyelement=\"1024\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"531\"></h2><hr data-identifyelement=\"532\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1687184087117\" data-identifyelement=\"1024\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-do-you-need-to-know?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1687185309528\" data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\">What do you need to know?</strong></h2><ul data-identifyelement=\"1025\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1026\">Starting July 5, 2023, all SMS and MMS messages to U.S. phone numbers using 10DLC phone numbers <strong data-identifyelement=\"1027\">must go through a registered A2P campaign</strong>.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1028\">Setting up new phone numbers or messaging campaigns will require additional time for data collection, submission, processing, and third-party approval.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1687185538689\" data-identifyelement=\"1029\" dir=\"ltr\">If you send messages using unregistered phone numbers, Phone providers will gradually increase message blocking, starting July 5, 2023, leading to a full block after August 31, 2023.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1030\">Blocked messages will receive error code 30034 for unregistered 10DLC messages.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1031\" dir=\"ltr\">Unregistered Messaging rates will still apply, even for blocked messages.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1687185187448\" data-identifyelement=\"1032\" dir=\"ltr\">To check your phone numbers' A2P 10DLC registration status, refer to our<span data-identifyelement=\"534\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">&nbsp;<a class=\"tdfocus-1687185187794\" data-identifyelement=\"1033\" href=\"48001226976-leadconnector-phone-system-trust-center.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LC Phone System Trust Center</a></span> guide.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"1034\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1035\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1036\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1037\"></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1687185296199\" data-identifyelement=\"1038\" id=\"Why-is-this-happening?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"535\">Why is this happening?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"1039\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1040\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1041\"></span></p><ul class=\"tdfocus-1687185207518\" data-identifyelement=\"1042\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1687185196881\" data-identifyelement=\"1043\" dir=\"ltr\">Starting July 5, 2023, message blocking will gradually increase to allow customers to transition to registered A2P campaigns before the Phone providers fully block unregistered messages on August 31, 2023.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1687185208691\" data-identifyelement=\"1044\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"536\">Major U.S. telecommunications carriers</strong> require U.S. A2P 10DLC registration to establish a fully verified messaging ecosystem.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"1046\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1047\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1048\"></span></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1687185218740\" data-identifyelement=\"1049\" id=\"What-do-you-need-to-do?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"537\">What do you need to do?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"1050\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1051\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1052\"></span></p><ul class=\"tdfocus-1687185543401\" data-identifyelement=\"1053\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1054\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1055\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">No further action is needed if you already use registered A2P campaigns for all your U.S. messaging.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1056\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1057\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">If you rely on provisioning new 10DLC phone numbers to send messages to U.S. recipients, associate those numbers with an approved A2P campaign or initiate a new A2P campaign registration.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1687185259002\" data-identifyelement=\"1058\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1059\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Note that A2P campaign registration takes time and requires third-party cooperation for carrier approval. Refer to our <a class=\"tdfocus-1687185235537\" data-identifyelement=\"1060\" href=\"155000000175-a2p-10dlc-campaign-vetting-changes-january-2023.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a data-identifyelement=\"538\" href=\"155000000859-a2p-10dlc-campaign-vetting-changes-january-2023.html\">A2P 10DLC Campaign Vetting Changes</a></span> guide for processing time updates. Check out <a class=\"tdfocus-1687185217209\" data-identifyelement=\"1061\" href=\"155000000174-a2p-10dlc-campaign-approval-best-practices.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"539\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">A2P 10DLC Campaign Approval Best Practices</span></a><span data-identifyelement=\"540\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1062\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1063\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Consider using Toll-Free phone numbers and <a class=\"tdfocus-1687185283456\" data-identifyelement=\"1064\" href=\"155000000180-toll-free-number-registration-for-lc-phone-us-canada-.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">completing Toll-Free Verification</a> as an alternative to A2P 10DLC for your specific use cases.</span></li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006842-button-element-in-email-builder", "title": "Button Element in Email Builder", "folder": "Email Builder Capabilities", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345234/original/6UKIIfPfSc5XJgJ83Ml0D4z382YVmLgOZAcf8d.jpg?1761937053", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345221/original/YTAE-YcPoiR0AU-uncf3OCX3JgOKOzx_CQa428.jpg?1761937019", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345232/original/Op9MfxNAwGbR32HpAJ7bWukF_CXGSOJRAwc44c.jpg?1761937051", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345233/original/YXttmgyfo2PFzzeoFhxLVLTxTq5llABvDg7f49.jpg?1761937052", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345230/original/yGnw-0Pz3-4RzXVPok97h3tlpcYPDxbP7gc44c.jpg?1761937051"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"210\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The Button Element allows you to add clickable buttons to your email templates, helping you drive engagement through clear and visually appealing calls to action (CTAs). You can fully customise the button\u2019s text, colour, size, and link destination to match your email design and brand style.</p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006822?portalId=48000045315#What-is-the-Button-Element-in-Email-Builder?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">What is the Button Element in Email Builder?</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006822?portalId=48000045315#Key-Benefits-of-the-Button-Element\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Key Benefits of the Button Element</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006822?portalId=48000045315#How-To-Setup-the-Button-Element\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">How To Setup the Button Element</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000006822?portalId=48000045315#Frequently-Asked-Questions\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"769\" data-start=\"720\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is the Button Element in Email Builder?</strong></h2><p data-end=\"1057\" data-start=\"771\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"1057\" data-start=\"771\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The Button Element is a drag-and-drop block that lets you insert a fully customisable CTA button into your email layout. You can adjust its design, alignment, and link destination to fit your goals such as directing recipients to a landing page, product page, or event registration.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1059\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Buttons are essential for guiding user actions and improving click-through rates. With this element, you can style them to stand out while maintaining a consistent look across all devices.</p><blockquote data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1251\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 6px 6px 1px 1em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0.5em; font-size: 13px; border-left: 1px dotted rgb(153, 153, 153); line-height: 22px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><p data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1253\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\"><strong data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1253\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Note:</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">&nbsp;Buttons are built using HTML and render reliably in most email clients. Always preview your design on both desktop and mobile to ensure proper display.</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1423\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Benefits of the Button Element</strong></h2><p data-end=\"1539\" data-start=\"1464\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Adding the Button Element to your email design provides several benefits:</p><ul data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1541\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1541\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1543\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Create clear and effective calls to action with ease.</p></li><li data-end=\"1669\" data-start=\"1599\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1669\" data-start=\"1601\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Customise button text, colour, and size to match your design theme.</p></li><li data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1670\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1672\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Add links to direct users to specific pages or actions.</p></li><li data-end=\"1787\" data-start=\"1730\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1787\" data-start=\"1732\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Align and space buttons precisely for visual balance.</p></li><li data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1788\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1790\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Automatically responsive across mobile and desktop devices.</p></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"1894\" data-start=\"1858\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How To Setup the Button Element</strong></h2><p data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1896\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Follow these steps to add and configure the Button Element in your email template:</p><ol data-end=\"3195\" data-start=\"1982\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"2066\" data-start=\"1982\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2066\" data-start=\"1985\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Navigate to <strong data-end=\"2031\" data-start=\"1997\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Marketing \u2192 Emails \u2192 Templates</strong> from your sub-account dashboard.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345234/original/6UKIIfPfSc5XJgJ83Ml0D4z382YVmLgOZAcf8d.jpg?1761937053\" class=\"fr-fil fr-di